// dyn(2^128) >s const 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF -> 1. 2^128 is non-negative with an
// upper limb (limb2) set, so a > b regardless of b's limb0 magnitude -> 1.
// Push const RHS (max u64) first, dynamic LHS (2^128) on top.
PUSH8 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
PUSH32 0x0000000000000000000000000000000100000000000000000000000000000000
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
SGT
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH1 0x00
RETURN
